{"seq":5,"slug":"agentic-benchmarks","title":"Agentic 能力基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape/agentic-benchmarks","wordCount":2019,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"agentic-能力基准\">Agentic 能力基准</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>Agentic 能力基准评估的是模型作为**智能体（Agent）**的能力：在多轮交互中使用工具、操作真实环境、跨多步完成一个有验收标准的任务。它与静态问答基准有三点本质区别：环境有状态（一步做错会改变后续局面）、时间跨度长（数十到上百轮动作）、验收可执行（以任务是否真正完成为准，而非答案字符串匹配）。2024 年起，随着推理模型与 Agent 脚手架成熟，这一子领域成为评测增长最快的方向——截至写作时，头部实验室的模型发布几乎必报 SWE-Bench、τ-bench 或终端类成绩。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[Agentic 基准] --&gt; B[对话与工具调用]&#10;    A --&gt; C[Web 环境]&#10;    A --&gt; D[桌面 GUI]&#10;    A --&gt; E[终端命令行]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[tau-bench]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[tau2-bench]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[WebArena]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[OSWorld]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[Terminal-Bench]&#10;    F[通用助理任务] --&gt; G[GAIA]\">graph TB\n    A[Agentic 基准] --&gt; B[对话与工具调用]\n    A --&gt; C[Web 环境]\n    A --&gt; D[桌面 GUI]\n    A --&gt; E[终端命令行]\n    B --&gt; B1[tau-bench]\n    B --&gt; B2[tau2-bench]\n    C --&gt; C1[WebArena]\n    D --&gt; D1[OSWorld]\n    E --&gt; E1[Terminal-Bench]\n    F[通用助理任务] --&gt; G[GAIA]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>基准</th>\n<th>出品方与锚点</th>\n<th>环境类型</th>\n<th>任务规模</th>\n<th>验收方式</th>\n<th>难度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>τ-bench</td>\n<td>Sierra AI，arXiv:2406.12045（2024-06）</td>\n<td>对话 + API 工具</td>\n<td>航空/零售两域数百场景</td>\n<td>数据库终态比对</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>τ²-bench</td>\n<td>Sierra AI（2025-06）</td>\n<td>对话 + 双方均可操作工具</td>\n<td>新增电信域</td>\n<td>数据库终态比对</td>\n<td>更高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebArena</td>\n<td>CMU，ICLR 2024（2023-07 发布）</td>\n<td>自托管真实网站</td>\n<td>812 条长程任务</td>\n<td>功能性断言</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OSWorld</td>\n<td>Xie et al., NeurIPS 2024</td>\n<td>真实 Ubuntu 桌面 + 应用</td>\n<td>369 条真实任务</td>\n<td>可执行检查脚本</td>\n<td>极高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Terminal-Bench</td>\n<td>斯坦福与 Laude Institute（2025-05）</td>\n<td>Docker 容器内纯终端</td>\n<td>持续扩充的任务集</td>\n<td>容器内自动化判分</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GAIA</td>\n<td>Meta/HF，arXiv:2311.12983（2023-11）</td>\n<td>开放网页 + 文件工具</td>\n<td>466 题、3 个难度级</td>\n<td>答案精确匹配</td>\n<td>中高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"bench-工具使用与规则遵循\">τ-bench：工具使用与规则遵循</h2><p>τ-bench（Tau-Bench）模拟客服 Agent 场景：Agent 一边与扮演用户的 LLM 对话，一边调用领域 API（退改签、订单管理）完成请求。它同时考察<strong>工具选择正确性</strong>与<strong>政策规则遵循</strong>（如&quot;不可退的票不能退&quot;），任何一处违规即判失败。</p>\n<h3 id=\"pass-k-指标\">pass^k 指标</h3><p>τ-bench 的核心指标是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pass}^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pass</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：同一任务独立重复 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次，要求<strong>全部成功</strong>的概率。设第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 次尝试成功的指示变量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_i \\in \\{0,1\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mtext>@</mtext><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><munderover><mo>∏</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>k</mi></munderover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"true\">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pass}^k = \\mathbb{E}\\left[\\prod_{i=1}^{k} c_i\\right], \\qquad \\mathrm{pass}\\text{@}k = \\mathbb{E}\\left[1 - \\prod_{i=1}^{k}(1 - c_i)\\right]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0935em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pass</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pass</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.1138em;vertical-align:-1.2777em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.8361em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.8723em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">=</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\">∏</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-4.3em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.05em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2777em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size4\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mtext>@</mtext><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pass}\\text{@}k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pass</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">@</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 衡量&quot;重试 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 次至少成一次&quot;的上限，而 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pass}^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pass</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 衡量可靠性下限——两者差距越大，说明 Agent 行为越不稳定。对要上生产环境的客服/交易类 Agent，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pass}^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0085em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pass</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 这类严格口径比单次成功率更接近真实风险。</p>\n<h3 id=\"从-bench-到-bench\">从 τ-bench 到 τ²-bench</h3><p>τ²-bench 的关键增量是<strong>双控（dual-control）</strong>：用户侧也能执行物理世界的操作（如&quot;重启路由器&quot;），Agent 必须通过对话引导用户配合操作自己无法触达的部分。这把评测从&quot;Agent 用工具&quot;推进到&quot;Agent 协调人与工具&quot;，据公开报告，发布时最强模型在电信域的成绩仍远低于其单控域表现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"webarena-与-osworld-真实环境评测\">WebArena 与 OSWorld：真实环境评测</h2><h3 id=\"webarena-自托管网站上的长程任务\">WebArena：自托管网站上的长程任务</h3><p>WebArena 在本地部署四个功能完整的站点（自建 GitLab、Reddit 克隆、电商站、地图应用），任务形如&quot;告诉我上周提交了最多代码的同事所在国家的首都&quot;。平均需要数十步动作，验收用功能性断言（页面状态、数据库内容）而非文本匹配。它确立了三条沿用至今的设计原则：<strong>环境可复现（全部自托管）、任务可验证（程序化判分）、行为留痕（轨迹可审计）</strong>；其轻量子集 WebArena-Lite 被后续大量 Web Agent 工作采用。</p>\n<h3 id=\"osworld-完整操作系统作为考场\">OSWorld：完整操作系统作为考场</h3><p>OSWorld 把评测环境直接放到真实 Ubuntu 桌面：369 个任务横跨 Chrome、LibreOffice、GIMP、VLC 与系统设置，每条任务配有初始化脚本与验收脚本。发布时最强模型的端到端成功率仅约 12%（人类约 72%），此后社区推出 <strong>OSWorld-Verified</strong> 修正了部分任务定义缺陷。截至写作时，头部 GUI Agent 的成绩据公开报道已爬升到远高于首发水位的区间，但不同脚手架之间差异仍然巨大——引用时必须注明脚手架与步数预算。</p>\n<h3 id=\"terminal-bench-命令行里的软件工程\">Terminal-Bench：命令行里的软件工程</h3><p>Terminal-Bench 由斯坦福与 Laude Institute 于 2025 年 5 月推出，任务运行在 Docker 容器中，Agent 只能通过终端（shell 命令与文件读写）完成编译、调试、数据处理等目标，容器内的自动化脚本给出客观判分。它剥离了 GUI 与 API 的便利层，最接近&quot;给 Agent 一台裸机器&quot;的真实形态；其排行榜同时区分<strong>任务本身</strong>与**脚手架（harness）**两个变量，是观察 Agent 工程能力的重要窗口。软件工程方向的姊妹基准 SWE-Bench 见 <a href=\"coding-benchmarks\">代码能力基准</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"排行榜生态-lmarena-与-livebench\">排行榜生态：LMArena 与 LiveBench</h2><p>Agentic 时代，单一静态基准不足以支撑选型决策，实际生态由三层构成：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[排行榜生态] --&gt; B[真人盲测对战&lt;br/&gt;LMArena]&#10;    A --&gt; C[动态防污染题库&lt;br/&gt;LiveBench]&#10;    A --&gt; D[垂直能力榜&lt;br/&gt;SWE-Bench / tau-bench / Terminal-Bench 等]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[大规模众包成对比较&lt;br/&gt;Bradley-Terry/Elo 排名]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[每月换题 + 客观判分]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[可执行环境的专项成绩]\">flowchart TD\n    A[排行榜生态] --&gt; B[真人盲测对战&lt;br/&gt;LMArena]\n    A --&gt; C[动态防污染题库&lt;br/&gt;LiveBench]\n    A --&gt; D[垂直能力榜&lt;br/&gt;SWE-Bench / tau-bench / Terminal-Bench 等]\n    B --&gt; B1[大规模众包成对比较&lt;br/&gt;Bradley-Terry/Elo 排名]\n    C --&gt; C1[每月换题 + 客观判分]\n    D --&gt; D1[可执行环境的专项成绩]</pre><h3 id=\"lmarena-众包偏好排名\">LMArena：众包偏好排名</h3><p>LMArena（前身为 LMSYS 于 2023 年 5 月上线的 Chatbot Arena）让匿名用户对两个模型的回答盲测投票，用 Bradley-Terry 模型聚合为排名。两模型 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的胜率由评分差决定：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>≻</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>400</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P(i \\succ j) = \\frac{1}{1 + 10^{(R_j - R_i)/400}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≻</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1248em;vertical-align:-0.8034em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.2799em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8301em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.0051em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2819em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3281em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.357em;margin-left:-0.0077em;margin-right:0.0714em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.5em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size3 size1 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.143em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/400</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8034em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>它的优势是规模（百万级投票）与难以针对性训练作弊；局限是用户偏好偏向&quot;讨喜的长回答&quot;（后引入风格控制 style control 缓解）、且测的是聊天体验而非任务完成度。Arena-Hard 等衍生榜单试图用更难的提示弥补后者。</p>\n<h3 id=\"livebench-动态防污染题库\">LiveBench：动态防污染题库</h3><p>LiveBench（arXiv:2406.19314，2024-06 上线）针对污染问题反向设计：题目每月从最新的论文、新闻、竞赛数据源生成并定期整体更换，全部采用有客观标准答案的判分（数学、推理、编码、语言、数据分析、指令遵循六类），不依赖 LLM 评审。它牺牲了对战式榜单的大众参与度，换取&quot;当前成绩可信未被做题&quot;的可核验性，与 LMArena 形成互补。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三层生态的使用姿势\">三层生态的使用姿势</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策问题</th>\n<th>优先看</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选型做产品 Agent</td>\n<td>垂直能力榜（对应你环境的那一层）</td>\n<td>任务完成度才是业务指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>追踪前沿代际跃迁</td>\n<td>LiveBench + 各垂直榜</td>\n<td>抗污染、可横向对比</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>感知&quot;体感好坏&quot;争议</td>\n<td>LMArena（带风格控制）</td>\n<td>反映真实用户偏好但有偏差</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"方法论要点\">方法论要点</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>方差必须报告</strong>：Agentic 成绩对采样与脚手架极其敏感，单次运行的数字没有意义，应报告 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow><mi>k</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{pass}^k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0435em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">pass</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>/多次均值与置信区间</li>\n<li><strong>环境快照化</strong>：网站版本、容器镜像、依赖版本都要钉死，否则成绩随环境漂移不可复现</li>\n<li><strong>沙箱隔离</strong>：Agent 可执行任意代码与命令，评估必须在一次性容器/虚拟机中进行</li>\n<li><strong>成本与步数预算入表</strong>：同样的成功率可能消耗数倍 token 与步数，效率是选型的真实维度</li>\n<li><strong>防污染靠动态化</strong>：环境交互类任务天然抗静态泄露，但开放网页类（GAIA）仍需定期换题</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>Agentic 基准与静态问答的本质区别在于环境有状态、任务长程、验收可执行，2024 年后成为评测增长最快的子领域</li>\n<li>τ-bench/τ²-bench 考工具与规则遵循（pass^k 衡量可靠性），WebArena/OSWorld 考真实 Web 与桌面操作，Terminal-Bench 考纯终端软件工程</li>\n<li>排行榜生态分三层互补：LMArena 测真人偏好、LiveBench 测抗污染能力、垂直榜测任务完成度——选型时按决策问题选对层</li>\n<li>引用 Agentic 成绩必须注明脚手架、采样策略与步数预算，否则数字不可比</li>\n<li>评估必须在快照化沙箱环境中运行，并报告方差与成本</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>单文件级代码修复基准与 Verified 口径的演进：<a href=\"coding-benchmarks\">代码能力基准</a></li>\n<li>长链推理如何改变各基准区分度：<a href=\"reasoning-benchmarks\">推理能力基准</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Agentic 能力基准","id":"agentic-能力基准"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"τ-bench：工具使用与规则遵循","id":"bench-工具使用与规则遵循"},{"level":3,"text":"pass^k 指标","id":"pass-k-指标"},{"level":3,"text":"从 τ-bench 到 τ²-bench","id":"从-bench-到-bench"},{"level":2,"text":"WebArena 与 OSWorld：真实环境评测","id":"webarena-与-osworld-真实环境评测"},{"level":3,"text":"WebArena：自托管网站上的长程任务","id":"webarena-自托管网站上的长程任务"},{"level":3,"text":"OSWorld：完整操作系统作为考场","id":"osworld-完整操作系统作为考场"},{"level":3,"text":"Terminal-Bench：命令行里的软件工程","id":"terminal-bench-命令行里的软件工程"},{"level":2,"text":"排行榜生态：LMArena 与 LiveBench","id":"排行榜生态-lmarena-与-livebench"},{"level":3,"text":"LMArena：众包偏好排名","id":"lmarena-众包偏好排名"},{"level":3,"text":"LiveBench：动态防污染题库","id":"livebench-动态防污染题库"},{"level":3,"text":"三层生态的使用姿势","id":"三层生态的使用姿势"},{"level":2,"text":"方法论要点","id":"方法论要点"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"多模态评估基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape/multimodal-benchmarks"},"next":{"title":"评估框架设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/eval-framework-design"}}